WEBVTT

00:12:29.825 --> 00:12:33.359
What all of these
technologies attempt to do

00:12:33.383 --> 00:12:40.180
is to force-fit a standardized model
of a predictable reality

00:12:40.204 --> 00:12:43.572
onto a world that is
infinitely surprising.

00:12:44.926 --> 00:12:46.278
What gets left out?

00:12:46.965 --> 00:12:49.568
Anything that can't be measured --

00:12:50.451 --> 00:12:52.810
which is just about
everything that counts.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:13:00.775
(Applause)